    sections[5]='**As proposed:** All 42 groups are sensitivity-framed, including retained selected18 comparison context. **As judged after execution:** Sensitivity remains the appropriate framing for every group. Named failures locate tested conflicts; they do not establish an optimized boundary or a physical confidence interval. Multi-input cases are coordinated scenarios, not isolated causal effects.'
    per=[];axisrows=[]
